msgid ""
"Spotify's own player, running on this computer. Sirensong sets it up and "
"keeps it updated."
msgstr ""
"Spotifys egen spelare, som körs på den här datorn. Sirensong ställer in den "
"och håller den uppdaterad."

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:321
msgid "Get your personal key from Spotify."
msgstr "Hämta din personliga nyckel från Spotify."

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:322
msgid "Sirensong downloads the player."
msgstr "Sirensong hämtar spelaren."

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:323
msgid "Choose it once in the Spotify app."
msgstr "Välj den en gång i Spotify-appen."

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:332 src/ui/soloist.rs:910
msgid "Set up Soloist"
msgstr "Ställ in Soloist"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:338
msgid "Requires Spotify Premium."
msgstr "Kräver Spotify Premium."

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:349 src/ui/soloist.rs:935
msgid "Setup, privacy and limitations"
msgstr "Installation, integritet och begränsningar"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:365
msgid "Get your Soloist key"
